     Selection: smallest-first, cap 22                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
     P2QPK inputs are enormous. At the default 0.0001 QOGE/kB, one extra input is about 4322 vB ≈ 0.000432 QOGE of fee. Tiny deposits are the ones that become permanently uneconomical if left to be spent one-by-one later. Largest-first would pay 0.001 with a few fat coins and strand the dust. Oldest-first is weak here: a FUNDED address already required every UTXO ≥ 20 conf.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
     Order: amount ascending, then txid, then vout. Deterministic, no scan-order accidents.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
     Ordinary send (target = requested amount; fee depends on n and change):                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
     1. Sort all UTXOs as above.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
     2. Add coins in that order, after each add re-run PlanP2QPKFee with the current count, until total ≥ send + fee or 22 coins.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
     3. If 22 smallest still cannot cover: take the 22 largest (same tie-break inverted). If that still cannot cover → insufficient funds (not a size error).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
     4. Stop as soon as coverage succeeds so a 0.001 send does not drag in 22 dust coins when 3 would do. Dust-first only means “prefer dust among coins you actually need,” not “always fill 22.”                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
     Withdraw-maximum (checkbox on):                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
     • Always take min(22, n) in smallest-first order.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
     • PlanP2QPKWithdrawAll on that subset only (fee subtracted from the subset total, one output, no change).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
     • Leftover count = n - selected.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
